      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Mam ochotę na* and the accusative says what you feel like: *mam ochotę na kawę*, *masz ochotę na jajecznicę?* A happy yes is *chętnie!* (gladly!). Eggs come *na miękko* (soft-boiled, about three minutes) or *na twardo* (hard-boiled), and *jajecznica* is scrambled eggs."
      }
    }
